    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koco ma tuti macwer wok i delkwoŋ jo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oluwo gi Musa kodi Aron, ka waco ni: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luw win gi Joisiraili aka wiwaci rijo ni, “Ka nyatoro moro je nitie gi tuti macwer wok kwoŋe, tuti loko go makoc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koco macwer tuti pere obedo me: Obedi ni kwoŋe cwer tuti, kosa kwoŋe ocungo cwer tuti, obedo koco rigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisi kitanda moro je ma ŋata cwero tuti onind'iye labedo makoc; aka kisi gimoro je ma go obed'iye labedo makoc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyatoro moro je m'ogey kitanda pere ripo lwoko nangin pere, to lwokere gi pi, aka labedo makoc tundo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋat'obedi i wi gimoro je ma ŋata cwero tuti obed'iye ripo lwoko nangin pere, to lwokere gi pi, aka labedo makoc tundo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋat'ogey delkwoŋ ŋata cwero tuti ripo lwoko nangin pere, to jolwokere gi pi, aka labedo makoc tundo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ŋata cwer tuti oŋuli law kwoŋ ŋat'olony, kenyo go ripo lwoko nangin pere, to lwokere, aka labedo makoc tundo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwot gal moro je ma ŋata cwero tuti obed'iye labedo makoc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhano moro je m'ogey gimoro je manitie i ŋange labedo makoc tundo othieno, aka dhano moro je m'otiŋ nger gino ripo lwoko nangin pere, to jolwokere gi pi, aka labedo makoc tundo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋatimoro je ma ŋata cwero tuti ogey ma k'ologo cinge, ripo lwoko nangin pere, to lwokere gi pi, aka labedo makoc tundo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atawo ma lowo moro je ma ŋata cwero tuti ogey iripo baro woko; aka kisi atawo ma yath iripo lwoko gi pi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka ŋata cwer tuti olony kwoŋ tuti pere, go ripo kwano ndelo abirio ma lonyirok pere; aka ma ridho lonyo pere, go lalwoko nangin pere to lwokere i waŋ pi ma mol, aka labedo lony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo mar'aboro go latero akurin ario kosa njiwin ario, aka labino ruwaŋ Rwoth i dhiot ma Wema ma romo to miyo jacway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam lamiyo jo, acel ri mic ma cwako reco kodi acel ri mic awaŋa; to jacway ri Were i wi migam miyo cowirok ma lonyo rigo ruwaŋ Rwoth kwoŋ tuti pere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka dhano ojayo, go ripo lwok, delkwoŋe gibe gi pi, aka labedo makoc tundo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanga moro je kosa pien ma go ojayo iye iripo lwoko gi pi, aka labedo makoc tundo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jacwo onindo gi dhako to jayo, joje joripo lwoki gi pi, aka jolabedo makoc tundo othieno.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka dhako ruko dwe, go labedo i koco pere ma ndelo abirio, aka ŋat'ogey go labedo makoc tundo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisi gima go onindi iye je i hongo ma go ruko dwe, labedo makoc; aka kisi gima go obed'iye je bende labedo makoc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhano moro je m'ogey kitanda pere ripo lwoko nangin pere, to lwokere gi pi, aka labedo makoc tundo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋat'ogey gimoro je ma dheno obed'iye ripo lwoko nangin pere, to lwokere gi, aka labedo makoc tundo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obedi kitanda kosa kisi gima go obed'iye, ŋat'ogey labedo makoc tundo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jacwo moro onindo gi go, to remo dwe geyo go, go labedo makoc ma ndelo abirio; aka kitanda je ma jalo onind'iye, labedo makoc.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka dhako ocwero remo ma ndelo kweth, ma kalo hongo ma ruko dwe pere, kosa ka remo ocwer kwoŋe loyo hongo ma ruko dwe pere, ndelin no je ma go lamedo cwer remo go lamedere bedo makoc; paka i ndelin ma ruko dwe pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisi kitanda ma go onind'iye i ndelin no je ma remo cwer kwoŋe, ilatero paka kitanda makoc; aka kisi gimoro je ma go obed'iye labedo makoc, paka koco ma ruko dwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋat'ogey gigipiny me labedo makoc, aka lalwoko nangin pere, to lwokere gi pi, aka labedo makoc tundo othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka go olony i ruko dwe pere, go lakwano ndelo abirio, aka rumacen go labedo m'olony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo mar'aboro go latero akurin ario kosa njiwin ario to miyo jacway ri Were i wi migam i dhiot ma Wema ma romo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam lamiyo acel ri mic ma cwako reco kodi man ca ri cowirok awaŋa; aka jacway ri Were i wi migam lamiyo cowirok ma lonyo rigo ruwaŋ Rwoth kwoŋ koco pere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
